# The inbox holds what the subject handed over — a logo, font files, a brand book,
# reference images, sometimes a client's. It is read from disk and it is not this
# repo's to publish. Ignored by default; a run that genuinely wants to commit its
# own inbox force-adds it deliberately.
runs/*/inbox/
